BT 1 0 0 1 56 430.2 Tm (| JUPI 1 | PS4 \(CUH-1001A, "Aeolia" chip\) | by itself \(auto-start entry\) | PS4BOOT |) Tj T* ET
BT /F3 7.4 Tf 8.88 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 56 421.2 Tm (| JUPI 2 | PS4 Pro \("Belize" chip\) | a person picks it each time | PS4PROBIN |) Tj T* ET
BT /F2 11.5 Tf 13.8 TL ET
