BT /F1 9.3 Tf 11.16 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 48 283.6 Tm (the loader depends on how you start it; that is outside this manual.) Tj T* ET
BT /F2 11.5 Tf 13.8 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 48 254 Tm (3. NEVER do these) Tj T* ET
BT /F3 7.4 Tf 8.88 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 56 232 Tm (| Never | Why |) Tj T* ET
BT /F3 7.4 Tf 8.88 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 56 223 Tm (| "Initialize PS4" \(Settings or Safe Mode\) | Erases the disk, Linux included. This is how JUPI 2 was lost on Nov) Tj T* ET
