BT /F3 7.4 Tf 8.88 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 56 160 Tm (| Change the loader to "update" JUPI | Updates are files on the stick, done from Linux \(section 7\). The loader) Tj T* ET
BT /F3 7.4 Tf 8.88 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 56 151 Tm (stays fixed. |) Tj T* ET
BT /F3 7.4 Tf 8.88 TL ET
